target_verses.display_text:
The rulers of peoples gathered with Abraham’s God;
for the mighty of the earth belong to God;
they were greatly exalted.

A voice of one crying in the wilderness:
Prepare the way of the Lord;
make straight the paths of our God.

And the glory of the Lord will be seen,
and all flesh will see the salvation of God;
for the Lord has spoken.

Then Thou wilt delight in a sacrifice of righteousness,
an offering and burnt offerings;
then they will bring calves upon Thine altar.

They will perish, but Thou wilt remain;
all will grow old like a garment.
Like a cloak Thou wilt change them, and they will be changed.
